msgid "go-down"
msgstr "向下"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:102
msgid "Move down this field"
msgstr "下移这个字段"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:108
msgid ""
"Figure: QElectroTech nomenclature properties content request PopUp window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 物料清单属性内容请求弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:112
msgid ""
"The content request configuration can be saved and chosen from "
"**Configuration** section to increase working efficiency."
msgstr "内容请求配置可从 **配置** 部分保存和选择，以提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:114
msgid ""
"QElectroTech is working with SQLite database, nomenclature table content can"
" also be defined by SQL query."
msgstr "QElectroTech 使用 SQLite 数据库，物料清单表内容也可以通过 SQL 查询来定义。"

#: ../../source/users/reports/nomenclature/edit_nomenclature.rst:116
msgid ""
"Once the desired configuration is defined, press **OK** to apply changes."
msgstr "定义所需配置后，按 **OK** 应用更改。"
